# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Real project data — NEVER commit
# The master copies of your work are .sqt.json snapshots and the
# human-readable exports. They may contain project names, supplier
# names, defect figures and risk assessments.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.sqt.json
SQT_*.json
SQT_*.md
SQT_*.csv

# The fictional sample snapshot is safe to keep in the repo.
!examples/*.sqt.json

# Local scratch, ad-hoc backups and exported report folders
exports/
scratch/
backups/
*.backup
*.local.json
*.log

